- [x] Backup: nightly backup succeeded (see log)
- [x] Performance: LCP 1.9 s on the homepage
- [x] Rollback: previous version available

Recommendation: GO for 17:00.</pre></figure>
<figure class="sbs-lab__ev"><figcaption>GET https://harbourline.example/ on the production host (release candidate, 14:02) — response head</figcaption><pre class="sbs-lab__pre">&lt;!doctype html&gt;
