<h2 id="lab-sample">Declared sample data</h2><p>Every response below is a fixture written for this lab. harbourline.example and staging.harbourline.example do not exist; nothing was fetched from a real site. The fixture files are public downloads so you can run your own checks against them.</p>
<ul class="sbs-lab__downloads"><li><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0987/3925/7636/files/lab-technical-seo-fixture.zip?v=1789652965" download>Fixture: two HTML responses and the redirect log (zip)</a></li></ul>
<h2 id="lab-evidence">Evidence</h2>
